Uhm. You changed your settings to show experience points and turns. 
Perhaps you didn't think about the possible reasons for these to be off 
by default. But now you know one of them, right?
So it was just a normal Nethack YASD really, where you learn something 
new and come back stronger for the next game.

Myself I also have showexp and time turned on at game start, but I turn 
showexp off rather soon (when exact experience point number ceases to be 
of much interest) and time off whenever I feel something important might 
be hidden from me in the status line.

Just another YASD IMO. Truly annoying though, I agree. But you probably 
will learn from it, and your next character will do better..?

